<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Huns</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Hunnic</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Huns were a nomadic people who appeared on the edges of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/europe">Europe</a> in the late fourth century CE and built a powerful empire, most famously under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/attila">Attila</a>. Some historians have proposed that they were linked to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/xiongnu-empire">Xiongnu</a>, though the connection remains debated. The question forms part of the discussion of the Xiongnu Empire's legacy.</p></div>
